abstract: |
  THEA IA is a modular conversational AI assistant built with Python 3.11+.
  Features a Finite State Machine (FSM) architecture, multi-agent system,
  PostgreSQL database layer with multi-tenant support, Spanish NLP entity
  extraction, and comprehensive testing suite. Designed for enterprise
  scalability with 17 planned milestones covering core functionality,
  smart agents, ML/NLP pipelines, web client, infrastructure, and release
  management.
